"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"532","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Model: EH55-H1K2","c":[]},{"h":"Rated Capacity: 1KVA/1KW","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Type: Lead Acid Battery","c":[]},{"h":"Battery Capacity: 2*12V/9Ah","c":[]},{"h":"Input Voltage: 208/220/230/240VAC","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Specification","active":true,"cls":"tab-1","noExpand":false,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Description","active":false,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <h3>The Must EH55 H1K2 1KVA <a href=\"/ups-and-ips/online-ups\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Online UPS</a> is a high quality double conversion online UPS built to ensure clean and consistent power for critical devices. It delivers pure sine wave output and maintains uninterrupted operation even when the main power fails. Thanks to its zero millisecond transfer time, the UPS instantly switches to battery mode without any delay, making it suitable for sensitive equipment and professional environments.</h3><p><br></p><p>This model supports a wide input voltage range from 110 to 300 volts AC, which is ideal for areas with unstable electricity. It comes with two 12 volt 9 ampere hour sealed lead acid batteries that offer dependable backup time for essential tasks, secure data saving, or controlled device shutdown. The built in LCD display helps users monitor voltage levels, battery status, and loading conditions in real time.</p><p><br></p><p>The Must EH55 H1K2 1KVA Online UPS is suitable for home, office, server rooms, CCTV systems, and network setups that require stable power protection and long lasting performance.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>1KVA or 1000VA online UPS</li><li>True double conversion design</li><li>Zero millisecond transfer time</li><li>Pure sine wave output for sensitive electronics</li><li>Wide input voltage range from 110 to 300 volts AC</li><li>Two internal 12 volt 9 ampere hour batteries<